  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide improved access to water, sanitation and hygiene services, agricultural inputs, to credit and saving capacity, to market systems to improve the wellbeing, resilience, food security and livelihoods of conflict- and crisis-affected agro-pastoralist communities in Sudan</narrative>
